{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3fac2b68bbd13c6823cc872e071bb1207abb15cec51f554f33662c15af0b834e", "ja": "フェスが終わる。見舞いの真珠星が帰った\n後、織姫はひとり病室で「楽しかったー…」\nと呟く。織姫が亡くなって数年後『I.V.』\nはそれぞれの道を歩み始めていた。真珠星は\nあの日のステージを思い出している。", "zh": "庆典结束了。前来探望的真珠星离开\n后，织姬独自在病房里喃喃道：“好开心啊……”\n织姬去世数年后，《I.V.》各自踏上了自己的道路。真珠星\n想起了那天的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "7227352b8f3f65a11a5d7d759ccf3c7000586f549fb02191b846245ce21d47ef", "ja": "（ふたつの『I.V.』は、自分達に今できること。\nその、すべての力で、それぞれのステージに立った）", "zh": "（两个『I.V.』，是她们当下力所能及的事。\n她们倾尽那全部的力量，站上了各自的舞台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "d5049de13bcf416633a0c7d7e2fd243604e87922518124fca351d75fb7e886aa", "ja": "（前評判とか、世論とか。色々なものを\n吹き飛ばしたそのライブは……最高だったと、思う）", "zh": "（那场演出，将事前的评价、舆论等种种声音\n统统一扫而空……我觉得，那是最棒的演出）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1002_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "a5ac3b7b8fc082cf696fdf7aece13a82cbb5b7f883552cbad0f4a373429595c2", "ja": "（ライブが終わった後、織姫お姉ちゃんは、\n病室から出られなくなってしまった）", "zh": "（演出结束后，织姬姐姐再也无法走出病房了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "6a65230d8dd7a6d671ec45f44e1fd7ae6676e91f817c501cade3d8a48673f83d", "ja": "私ね、お医者さんになる夢は諦めないよ。別に、\n義務とかじゃなくて。私がなりたいから目指すだけ。", "zh": "我啊，不会放弃成为医生的梦想。并不是因为义务什么的，只是因为我想成为医生，所以才会去追逐这个梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a1d59aff500cff2c61a4bfbceae9b8a091cbd253bfafd50687833be8e449f38", "ja": "うん……そっかぁ……。\n真珠星は、もう私がいなくても大丈夫だね……。", "zh": "嗯……这样啊……\n真珠星就算没有我，也已经没问题了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "b059a02f023362042dbb05b94d9d6741132afa7d2bd95f9c1905d4cf69e67a27", "ja": "大丈夫じゃないよ……。大丈夫とか、\n大丈夫じゃないとか。そういうのじゃなくて……。", "zh": "才不是没关系呢……不是什么没关系、\n或者有关系的问题……根本不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "d6dc7667ce74320be157cc4fd35b967cd0ccdc7695215522f0eeecff47fab088", "ja": "お姉ちゃんがいなくなったら……\n私、寂しいよ……。", "zh": "要是姐姐不在了……\n我会很寂寞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "6ec9d29b1872d98e67e5950bae39401aa260715a5abaded3cb62f120ec36ac96", "ja": "そっかぁ……ごめんねぇ……。", "zh": "这样啊……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1010_kanngosi", "source_sha256": "475e38e4ffd9761e4fb42ac168424d264823cbd97424be150e8371e52ce4bd11", "ja": "ごめんなさい、一宮さん。\n面会の時間はそろそろ……。", "zh": "抱歉，一宫小姐。\n探视时间差不多要到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "6b8dd40a6d412715d66bda2e87a07e687190625d2183082091606abb64d88ada", "ja": "あ……はい。\n……お姉ちゃん、またね。", "zh": "啊……好的。\n……姐姐，下次见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1012_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "4644d4f885482aef8e1fcab0692994518ff5d357fca15bfdd980c1753367ba9e", "ja": "……本当はね、二度と、人前に\n出るつもりなんてなかったんだぁ……。", "zh": "……其实啊，我本来就没打算\n再出现在人前的呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "52e432e78dd1f2257a813779cc6213036e0e670d3d87d89dcdc853d70f3035f8", "ja": "でも、テレビで真珠星を見て……どんどん、\nアイドルになっていく真珠星を見てたら……。", "zh": "可是，看到电视上的珍珠星……看着她一步步成为偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "781b9338918fee835ce97984a1ff0f2b46ad49d355e059ed204df4b7762ef292", "ja": "真珠星と一緒に、歌いたくなっちゃったの。\nホント……ただ、それだけなんだぁ……。", "zh": "我就想和真珠星一起唱歌。\n真的……就只是这样而已……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "a1bc3c02cc7fbd1c051d98c0d4729690a10c53f11d97c39d9bff57e8d78adea1", "ja": "ああ……楽しかったー……。", "zh": "啊啊……真开心——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1017_null", "source_sha256": "a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a", "ja": "数週間後……", "zh": "数周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "9d6426e371f06b5a6f13ab17e07eb79a790df68a1b3546ee550a4ca4f6f4e65a", "ja": "（フェスが終わると、織姫お姉ちゃんは亡くなった。\nまるで、その役目を終えたとでもいうかのように……）", "zh": "（庆典结束后，织姬姐姐便去世了。\n仿佛她的使命已经完成了一般……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "2b44eec12e618f58c309977ceb41141d8b4beaf38e3b6a1211ab3ef64d0ad192", "ja": "（今日は、神宮寺さんに呼ばれてミーティング。\n議題は、『I.V.』の今後について）", "zh": "（今天，神宫寺小姐叫我们来开会。\n议题是关于“I.V.”今后的发展）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "dde7e5f06185dcd85a645a8d8c78c81d5775bc5bce621a57b028fee82920a8cc", "ja": "……そう。なら、私達の方針は決まりね。\n『I.V.』はこれからも続く。いいわね？", "zh": "……这样啊。那么，我们的方针就决定了。\n“I.V.”今后也会继续下去。没意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "b07b844908a987c437aa0c4178780abd7b8940a6ad06d53470b2ab30edeed3fe", "ja": "あ、でもひとつだけ！\n私、自分の夢を諦めたわけじゃないから。", "zh": "啊，不过还有一件事！\n我可没有放弃自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "941cca703d76806e0718004098b3f8ba322590001b9bbaa6b515d9854cf75040", "ja": "アイドルはもうちょっと続けるけど、\nその後は自分の夢を叶える。お医者さんになる！", "zh": "偶像我还会再做一阵子，\n但那之后我要去实现自己的梦想。成为一名医生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "cd4c589b8e2844c820a84e82a77c8be96d9ba1c3ab2e6aeab0d23fb1bd56fad4", "ja": "……欲張りね。", "zh": "……真贪心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f07228ea8b52445a53030657582f731a348a31bda213dcbc4538abbf1db5775", "ja": "そうだよ。\n私、織姫お姉ちゃんの妹だもん。", "zh": "就是啊。\n因为我可是织姬姐姐的妹妹嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1025_null", "source_sha256": "f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458", "ja": "数年後……", "zh": "数年后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "920cd6285913b48b7c411cbac8b6944111734d2848e6a6c5559a1f4742e1fce4", "ja": "（名実共にアイドルとしての頂点に立った私達は、\n『I.V.』でできる全ての夢を叶え、解散した）", "zh": "（我们成为了名副其实的顶尖偶像，\n实现了以“I.V.”之名所能实现的所有梦想后，解散了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "766212965a89f61dc33d2ccd6f8179605783db5186c100a9a5dbe325b29e3f17", "ja": "（クロエさんは、活動の拠点を海外に移した。\nなるちゃんは、アイドルと女優の兼業で頑張っている）", "zh": "（克洛伊小姐把活动据点转移到了海外。\n娜露则继续兼顾偶像和演员的工作，努力奋斗着）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d567d7dec4fe8c2c1dacf6f8ea74afabedd7b53dd1b8e5d049c311b9f79cdcb", "ja": "（藍さんは、相変わらずトップアイドルとして\n活躍している。そして私は……）", "zh": "（蓝小姐一如既往地作为顶尖偶像活跃着。\n而我……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1029_jinguuji", "source_sha256": "40fbda04c93bf51c39ba89ae0330fd8946e90a27c714748e282d95499d3bf22b", "ja": "真珠星、大丈夫？\n大学の入学式でしょ、忘れ物とかないの？", "zh": "真珠星，没事吧？\n今天是大学入学典礼吧，有没有忘带什么东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "44832d8cd35b2ac5bc608dff8c4ff860d672a4b7801074b4e2bc4d758b590055", "ja": "小学生じゃないんだから……大丈夫だよ。\nそれより、入学式の前に病院に行くんだよね？", "zh": "我又不是小学生了……没事的。\n比起这个，在入学典礼之前要去医院对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1031_jinguuji", "source_sha256": "70afe15947e7de06f9a61df64637d89c65ce081ab04dd7f5680cd5eac7cda0a6", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。\n車を回してくるわ。", "zh": "好的，就这样吧。\n我去把车开过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1032_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1033_itimiyasiratori", "source_sha256": "3fba706e958a675312f7ef050ad9b8b19af9175733a83e11a6c506633c30cf2f", "ja": "そっか、真珠星も今日からもう大学生なんだ。\nたくさん勉強しておいで。", "zh": "这样啊，真珠星从今天起也是大学生了。\n要好好学习哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "ff0cff6acf9de69055fe081b74e7d9a0ea1be415c3c2a17b47ba6856495e6595", "ja": "うん。お母さんの病気は、今度の新薬が\n承認されたら、一気に改善する可能性があるし……。", "zh": "嗯。只要这次的新药获批，妈妈的病情就有可能一下子好转……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1035_044miz", "source_sha256": "89e8258938f24dc7554ae4c9229c093f2a36f5c31030d7f493e1fc15f47e6815", "ja": "お姉ちゃんの時は、間に合わなかったけど……\nお母さんには、それまで頑張ってもらうから。", "zh": "姐姐那时候没能赶上……但我会让妈妈坚持到那时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1036_itimiyasiratori", "source_sha256": "93dbeec2193b1108beaa3d18c03e4cef6e8dfc4b512d9409c5c17c072e7ed03c", "ja": "はいはい。\n七星、真珠星のことよろしくね。", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n七星，真珠星就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1037_jinguuji", "source_sha256": "7c715b41f06cbb9756e8e21bd87c624a8e4dd880d2618d88cd6b186d3b34728e", "ja": "わかった。お姉ちゃんはくれぐれも安静にね。\n……真珠星、そろそろ時間よ。", "zh": "知道了。姐姐你一定要好好静养哦。\n……珍珠星，差不多到时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "0d8ad3bcc1b1f8352d5e462af87389a306e578d867d8c1016fc8fb0ad462aebd", "ja": "うん。\n行こう、七星さん。", "zh": "嗯。\n走吧，七星小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "684d3e6379bf176fc262a91cd77f37939026685d4d374e1264b2d454337ec665", "ja": "（織姫お姉ちゃんと、『I.V.』のステージ。\n今までで、一番楽しい時間だった）", "zh": "（和织姬姐姐一起登上《I.V.》的舞台。\n那是我至今为止最开心的时光）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "ecf759ccac63eec156f56cea8a3169ad060530b08417d8a2b0e59807a062d20a", "ja": "（思い出せば、いつでもそこにお姉ちゃんがいる。\n……私は一生、あのステージを忘れない）", "zh": "（只要回想起来，姐姐就一直在那里。\n……我一生都不会忘记那场演出）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0369_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0369_story_08_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "c5be4c4c300b0d67141c09dc70279ff8b0b6748575d51fd3fa13cfe7236be1eb", "ja": "お姉ちゃん。\n私に『I.V.』をくれて、ありがとう……。", "zh": "姐姐。\n谢谢你把《I.V.》送给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
